+    /// Cache key for ``size(of:whenDisplayedIn:proposedWidth:proposedHeight:environment:)``.
+    /// Omperator: every layout pass re-measures every Text view, and each
+    /// measurement builds a fresh Pango context (fontconfig work) — the
+    /// dominant per-pass cost on dense views. Text measurements are stable
+    /// for the same widget/font/content/proposal, so memoize them.
